Bazzite Horizon
===============

Bazzite with a Hyprland desktop and the Event Horizon shell.
Project page: https://github.com/CipherVLT/horizon-forge

At the login screen, open the session menu and choose Event Horizon.
KDE Plasma is still installed and listed there too.

First login creates ~/.config/hypr/hyprland.conf and a default wallpaper
setting only if they don't exist yet. Your edits are never overwritten.

The computer boots with GRUB. A systemd-boot entry is also placed on the
EFI partition and can be picked from the firmware boot menu.

  ujust update        update everything
  ujust horizon-info  show the image and Event Horizon version
  sudo bootc rollback go back to the previous version (then reboot)
